Subject: [M149] [baseline] Fix integer overflow in instruction size estimation

Original change's description:
> [baseline] Fix integer overflow in instruction size estimation
>
> Use base::CheckedNumeric<int> for EstimateInstructionSize to prevent
> integer overflow when calculating estimated instruction size for very
> large bytecode arrays.
>
> Also update baseline batch compiler to handle CheckedNumeric and prevent
> overflow of estimated_instruction_size_.
>
